export anchor ExecutiveNavyStyle:
    number: 336
    screen: CrmPipeline
    name: Executive navy
    idea: The pipeline as a formal quarterly board paper in deep navy and gold, with large serif figures between double gold rules, a numbered ledger of stages with leader lines, and notes for the board set apart.
    base: dark
    palette:
        navy: #0d1628, the page and the style sheet
        panel: #13203a, the notes panel and fields
        rule: #2c3d5e, single rules between stages and figures
        ink: #ece6d6, ivory text
        muted: #a9b3c7, small caps labels, owners and remarks
        gold: #e2c47a, figures, roman numerals, headings, primary button and focus
        goldRule: #7a6538, double rules, dotted leaders and the secondary border
        onGold: #1a1404, text on gold
        coral: #f2a08f, Stalled and Attention with a triangle
        sage: #a8d5a2, Closed with a check
    type:
        A serif stack, Iowan Old Style, Palatino Linotype, Palatino, Book
        Antiqua, Georgia, with labels in Gill Sans, Optima, Candara, Segoe
        UI. Base 16px. The title is 38px at 400, figures 40px in gold with
        oldstyle numerals, stage names 20px, deal values 19px, section
        heads 13px sans uppercase at 600 tracked .26em, remarks 14px italic.
    layout:
        A centred masthead holds a round gold outline monogram B, the house
        name in tracked caps, the title Quarterly Pipeline Review and an
        italic line Fourth quarter, deal pipeline, with Owners and New deal
        set top right. Five figures sit centred in a band between double
        gold rules and split by thin rules, the won figure with 64 percent
        of target in italic and a thin gold bar. Below, a wide ledger titled
        Pipeline by stage lists five stages with large italic roman numerals
        I to V, the stage name, deal count in italic and the stage total on
        the right. Each deal is a line with a dotted gold leader to its
        value, and an italic line under it with the owner and a remark. A
        320px navy panel with a 3px gold top bar holds Notes for the board
        as a numbered list, the third flagged Attention in coral. Below
        960px the notes drop under the ledger, below 600px figures go two
        by two.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 40px page gutter, 48px between ledger and notes, 18px stage padding, 16px on phones.
    density: Low. A board paper read top to bottom, one line per deal.
    corners: None. Square everywhere except the round monogram.
    borders: Double gold rules round the figures and atop the sheet, single navy rules between stages, dotted gold leaders, a 3px gold bar on the notes.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Few, fine line icons at 1.6 stroke in gold before italic remarks.
        A coral triangle with the word for stalled, a sage check for closed.
    focus: A 1px gold outline with a navy gap and a second gold ring.
    tone: Formal and measured, such as Quarterly Pipeline Review, Notes for the board and Attention.
